[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1682","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1682.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0826","title":"Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 1.2 中的 ddicgi.exe 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送超长 GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 1.2 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0826"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32.863","remediation":"Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 1.2 已停止维护，厂商不再提供安全补丁。建议立即将 ddicgi.exe 程序从 Web 服务器中移除或重命名，并在 IIS/Web 服务器访问控制列表中禁止对 ddicgi.exe 的 GET 请求。同时迁移至受支持的文档管理解决方案，并在防火墙层面限制对该 Web 服务的公网访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a090800-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1657","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5210","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0826.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0826","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0826.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0826.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ddicgi.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0826.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1657/info.html","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ddicgi.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v4w5-7q96-xfmx/GHSA-v4w5-7q96-xfmx.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1682.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1668","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1668.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0812","title":"Sun Java Web Server 管理模块远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sun Java Web Server 管理模块存在远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过向管理模块上传恶意 Java 代码，然后请求以 /servlet/ 开头的 URL 调用 com.sun.server.http.pagecompile.jsp92.JspServlet，从而在服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，可导致服务器完全被控制。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0812"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31.923","remediation":"立即升级 Sun Java Web Server 至 2.0 版本（含补丁），该版本修复了管理模块中未经授权即可通过 /servlet/ 路径调用 JspServlet 上传并执行任意 Java 代码的问题。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器配置中删除或禁用管理模块（admin module），并限制对 /servlet/ 路径的访问，仅允许受信 IP 通过防火墙规则访问管理端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/197&type=0&nav=sec.sba","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1600","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2542","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5135","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0812.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0812","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0812.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0812.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rj9r-c2qp-rvpc/GHSA-rj9r-c2qp-rvpc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0812.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0a61a286-d2ee-46af-917e-edc0a585a940.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--0a61a286-d2ee-46af-917e-edc0a585a940.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1668.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0992","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0992.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0882","title":"Intel Express Switch ICMP包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于英特尔Express 500系列交换机的ICMP协议栈处理中，当设备接收到特制的畸形ICMP数据包时，会触发核心网络协议栈的异常处理，导致交换机系统内核中的CPU资源耗尽或完全崩溃，进而使整个设备无法正常工作。受影响的设备型号包括Intel Express Switch 2.63和2.64版本，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可远程发送这类畸形ICMP数据包，攻击过程非常隐蔽，一旦被利用，整个交换机设备将陷入瘫痪状态，导致所有连接到该交换机的终端设备失去网络连通性，严重影响企业网络的稳定性。该漏洞适用于大多数网络环境，只要存在运行Windows Server操作系统的英特尔Express 500系列交换机，即使是简单的网络攻击也能导致设备崩溃，无法提供任何网络服务，对企业的日常运营和网络安全构成严重威胁。微软和英特尔公司已发布安全公告，建议用户升级到最新固件版本以获取补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0882"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39.990","remediation":"立即将 Intel Express 500 系列交换机固件升级至最新版本 3.0.x 或更高版本，这包含完整的 ICMP 包处理修复和 CPU Crash 保护机制。如需紧急修复，可通过命令行临时禁用交换机上的所有 ICMP 入战机制（使用全局命令 `no ip icmp rate-limit`），并在防火墙层面部署 ACL 拒绝包含畸形 ICMP 载荷的流量，直到正式升级完成。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0533.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1647","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0882.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0882","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0882.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0882.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mq96-8pc5-pc47/GHSA-mq96-8pc5-pc47.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0882.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1647/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0882.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f2b352c4-c440-486c-9e50-2b2c7e5c90d6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0992.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0991","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0991.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0879","title":"LPPlus 打印服务提权漏洞","description":"LPPlus 打印服务组件（dccsched、dcclpdser、dccbkst、dccshut、dcclpdshut、dccbkstshut）安装时被设置为 setuid root 且全局可执行，导致任意本地用户均可启动或停止 LPD 打印服务进程，导致打印服务拒绝服务。攻击者仅需本地账户权限，无需认证即可直接执行上述程序控制打印守护进程，造成打印服务中断，影响范围涉及安装了 LPPlus 打印套件的 Unix/Linux 系统，CVSS 2.1 分值（本地访问/低复杂度/无需认证/部分可用性影响），属低危本地拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0879"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39.600","remediation":"建议立即卸载LPPlus服务或授予最小权限访问：`chmod 750 /usr/sbin/dccshed /usr/sbin/dcclpdser /usr/sbin/dccbkst /usr/sbin/dccshut /usr/sbin/dcclpdshut /usr/sbin/dccbkstshut`，并移除对所有用户的SetUID位。如果继续使用，必须限制用户到指定路径并启用系统审计日志记录以监控对LPD服务的任何启动/停止操作。建议安装最新的LPPlus安全补丁包（如版本X.X或更高），这些补丁修复了程序权限验证机制，并提供了强制访问控制策略来限制对这些服务的未授权访问。有关特定补丁或升级指南，请查阅供应商的公告或安全咨询。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0531.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1643","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5199","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0879","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0879.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-84v4-jv9m-4vfj/GHSA-84v4-jv9m-4vfj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0879.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0991.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0990","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0990.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0878","title":"mailto CGI 脚本 命令注入漏洞","description":"mailto CGI 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，由于对 emailadd 表单字段缺乏输入验证和过滤，远程未授权攻击者可通过提交包含 Shell 元字符（如分号、反引号、管道符等）的恶意邮件地址，在服务器上下文中执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响部署了易受攻击 mailto CGI 脚本的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），可导致服务器完全沦陷、敏感数据窃取及后续横向渗透。修复建议：升级或替换为安全的邮件处理组件，严格过滤用户输入中的 Shell 元字符，实施最小权限原则运行 CGI 脚本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0878"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39.473","remediation":"立即移除或替换漏洞 mailto CGI 脚本，改用安全的邮件处理库（如 Perl MIME::Lite、PHP mail() 等）并严格过滤 emailadd 等输入字段中的 Shell 元字符（; ` | & $ ( ) 等）；若必须保留 CGI，请以最低权限用户运行 CGI 进程，并在 Web 服务器层配置 WAF 规则拦截包含 Shell 元字符的请求。建议升级至现代 Web 框架（如 PHP/Node.js/Python 框架内置邮件发送功能）彻底替代老旧 CGI 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0088.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1669","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5241","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0878.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0878","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0878.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0878.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vjmf-fjqm-657f/GHSA-vjmf-fjqm-657f.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0878.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5c9910e7-0c34-46b7-87ed-da64bd3f7509.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0878.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0990.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0989","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0989.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0877","title":"Matt Wright MailForm 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"MailForm 2.0 的 mailform.pl CGI 脚本存在路径遍历漏洞，未对 XX-attach_file 参数进行路径验证，导致远程未认证攻击者可通过构造恶意文件路径（如 /etc/passwd）读取服务器任意文件内容，脚本会将文件内容作为附件发送给攻击者。影响 MailForm 2.0 版本，攻击条件为远程网络访问且无需认证，攻击者可直接通过 HTTP 请求发送包含恶意文件路径的 POST 请求实现任意文件读取，导致敏感信息泄露，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0877"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39.353","remediation":"建议立即停用或删除 MailForm 2.0 的 mailform.pl CGI 脚本，改用成熟安全的邮件表单处理程序（如 PHPMailer、Nodemailer 等现代框架）。若必须保留，需在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache 的 .htaccess 或 Nginx location 块）禁止访问 mailform.pl，或在脚本中对 XX-attach_file 参数实施严格路径遍历过滤（仅允许指定目录下的附件文件名，禁止目录遍历字符 ../ 等）。建议迁移至现代 Web 框架内置的邮件发送组件，彻底替换该老旧 CGI 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0092.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1670","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5224","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0877","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0877.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w24q-78r2-qqx9/GHSA-w24q-78r2-qqx9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1670/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/72eb3babf4053f474a6fa1578cb387378535ac53/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0989.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0989.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0989.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0988","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0988.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0876","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD和WFTPD Pro 2.41 RC12 全路径名泄露漏洞","description":"WFTPD及WFTPD Pro 2.41 RC12版本存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向服务器发送\"%C\"命令触发错误响应，服务器会在错误信息中泄露其完整绝对路径。该漏洞影响运行上述版本FTP服务的Windows系统，攻击者获取路径信息后可进一步辅助定位配置文件、脚本位置及其他敏感目录，为后续渗透攻击提供有利条件，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0876"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39.233","remediation":"升级到 WFTPD Pro 2.41 RC13 或更高版本以修复路径泄露漏洞，新版本已移除 \"%C\" 命令的路径回显。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 \"%C\" 命令的响应或在防火墙层限制对 FTP 服务的匿名访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。同时建议将 FTP 服务器安装在非系统盘符目录，并确保安装路径不包含敏感信息，以降低路径泄露带来的安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0488.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5829","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5196","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0876.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0876.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0876","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0876.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0876.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abf8bbe52cf51bfe6b014038b9aaf2c5c010ac07/2000/CVE-2000-0876.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0876.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1e95eda078cc027662ac8a3d9af8be2d7132ec73/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0876.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0876.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0876.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0988.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0987","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0987.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0875","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Texas Imperial Software wftpd 版本 2.41 RC12 存在处理异常字符的缺陷，当远程攻击者向服务器发送包含长串不可打印字符的数据包时，服务器在解析这些非法字符时会因缓冲区边界检查不足而引发内存溢出，导致核心组件崩溃，进而造成服务彻底不可用。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 Linux 操作系统上运行的 WFTPD 和 WFTPD Pro 服务器，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可远程触发，典型利用方式是构造包含大量不可打印 ASCII 字符的有效载荷并发送到控制端口，目标服务器在处理这些非法输入时会崩溃并停止响应。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0875"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39.110","remediation":"升级到 WFTPD Pro 2.41 RC13 或更高版本，更新 Texas Imperial Software wftpd 软件到最新稳定版本；在防火墙上配置对包含 \"cmp\" 或多个特殊字符的 HTTP 请求进行限制，限制有效载荷长度至 1024 字节以下；禁用 WFTPD 服务的匿名访问以减少攻击面；部署应用层防火墙规则以阻止包含异常宽字符的连串数据包；如需远程访问，请配置访问者白名单并要求强密码认证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0488.html","http://www.wftpd.com/bug_gpf.htm","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5194","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0875.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0875","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0875.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0875.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x8pf-r3xx-5739/GHSA-x8pf-r3xx-5739.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0875.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88349/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0875.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cc0d4389-5d7a-4332-97cd-47914557f713.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0987.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0986","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0986.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0874","title":"Qualcomm Eudora邮件客户端 虚拟通行证(VCF)路径泄露漏洞","description":"Eudora 邮件客户端在生成虚拟通行证（VCF 文件）时，会将发送者主机的绝对文件系统路径嵌入其中，导致本地路径信息泄露。攻击者可通过诱导受害者发送 VCF 文件或拦截邮件附件，解析其中的绝对路径获取受害者主机文件系统结构信息，辅助后续路径遍历、文件包含等攻击。该漏洞影响 Eudora 邮件客户端早期版本，CVSS 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），属中等危害，攻击者无需认证即可通过网络远程获取部分敏感路径信息。Qualcomm 已在后续版本中修复该路径泄露问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0874"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:38.987","remediation":"建议升级 Eudora 邮件客户端至 5.1 或更高版本（Qualcomm 已修复此问题），或在邮件客户端设置中禁用虚拟名片（VCF）附件功能以防止路径泄露。若无法升级，建议配置邮件客户端不自动发送 VCF 附件，或使用防火墙/邮件网关过滤包含绝对路径的 VCF 附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1545","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/80888","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1653","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5206","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0874.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0874","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/51d462e668438eaead0d5fabdd60f13269763472/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0874.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0874.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7592-5mm7-m9qv/GHSA-7592-5mm7-m9qv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0874.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0874.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fd0021b5-de05-41a4-bd0b-e56e703af98d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0986.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0985","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0985.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0871","title":"Khamil Landross And Zack Jones EFTP 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"EFTP 2.0.4.281 中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，当远程攻击者向服务器发送不包含换行的特殊字符串并快速断开连接时，程序的堆内存区域将被非法覆盖，导致核心程序崩溃无法响应。该漏洞影响 EFTP 服务端软件，直接导致拒绝服务攻击，无法继续提供网络文件传输服务。此外，攻击者可能通过精心构造的溢出载荷劫持程序执行任意代码，控制受影响主机。该漏洞属于典型的网络协议解析安全缺陷，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程触发，因此在互联网暴露的 EFTP 服务器均面临严重威胁。漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，资深级别，需要立即修复以确保网络文件传输服务的可用性和安全性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0871"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:38.617","remediation":"升级到包含安全补丁的 EFTP 2.0.4.282 或更高版本，修复缓冲区溢出漏洞；禁用不必要的 EFTP 服务，限制匿名访问权限，通过防火墙封锁端口2121/20000，将终端最大处理字符串长度限制为1024 字节，强制所有客户端在发送指令前使用 STX/ETX 帧标记数据结束，避免触发 DoS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0089.html","http://www.osvdb.org/409","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1677","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5220","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0871.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0871","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0871.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0871.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gg4h-2f4h-wg43/GHSA-gg4h-2f4h-wg43.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0871.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/eftp_dos.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0871.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0985.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0984","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0984.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0870","title":"EFTP EFTP 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"eftp FTP 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可向服务发送超长字符串导致缓冲区溢出，触发拒绝服务导致服务崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 eftp FTP 服务器软件，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发送恶意长字符串触发漏洞，导致服务进程崩溃拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危）。攻击者只需向目标 FTP 服务发送超长字符串即可触发缓冲区溢出导致拒绝服务，无需身份认证即可远程利用。建议升级到修复版本或限制 FTP 服务访问控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0870"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:38.503","remediation":"建议升级 eftp 到 0.6.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制 FTP 服务端口（默认 21 端口）仅允许受信 IP 访问，或暂时停用 eftp 服务直至完成升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0089.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1555","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1675","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5219","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0870.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0870","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0870.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0870.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q529-mj92-4xfq/GHSA-q529-mj92-4xfq.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ftp_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0870.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0984.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0983","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0983.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0868","title":"SuSE Linux Apache 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.4 默认安装的 Apache 1.3.12 存在默认配置错误，其 /cgi-bin-sdb/ 目录配置不当，允许远程未认证攻击者通过将请求 URL 中的 /cgi-bin/ 替换为 /cgi-bin-sdb/ 直接访问并下载 CGI 脚本的源代码。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 6.4 默认安装的 Apache 1.3.12，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需构造将 /cgi-bin/ 替换为 /cgi-bin-sdb/ 的 HTTP 请求即可读取 CGI 脚本源代码，导致敏感源代码泄露，CVSS 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），属于信息泄露类漏洞。SuSE 已发布补丁修复该配置错误。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0868"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:38.250","remediation":"建议升级 SuSE Linux 6.4 中的 Apache 至 1.3.14 或更高版本，或升级至 SuSE Linux 7.0 以上版本。临时缓解措施：编辑 httpd.conf 删除或注释掉 ScriptAlias /cgi-bin-sdb/ 配置行，重启 Apache 服务使配置生效，或在 Web 应用防火墙层面拦截包含 /cgi-bin-sdb/ 的请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q3/0906.html","http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a090700-2.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1658","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5197","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0868.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0868","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0868.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0868.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r7r9-rf39-874f/GHSA-r7r9-rf39-874f.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0868.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0868.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/suse_cgi_bin_sdb.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0983.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0983.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0983.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0982","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0982.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0866","title":"Borland Interbase 6 SuperServer 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Interbase 6 SuperServer for Linux 在处理包含 0 字节的数据库查询时存在输入验证缺陷，本地攻击者可通过发送包含空字节的恶意查询语句触发服务异常终止，导致数据库服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Interbase 6 SuperServer Linux 版本，攻击向量为本地访问（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需身份认证（Au:N），仅影响可用性（A:P），CVSS 评分 2.1 属低危级别。攻击者需具备本地数据库访问权限，通过构造包含空字节的 SQL 查询即可触发拒绝服务，导致数据库服务崩溃不可用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0866"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37.977","remediation":"建议升级 InterBase 到 6.0.1 或更高版本（如 Firebird 1.0 及以上版本），该版本已修复 SuperServer 在处理空字节查询时的拒绝服务漏洞。若无法立即升级，可通过防火墙限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问 3050/tcp 端口，或在防火墙层面过滤包含异常空字节的异常查询包作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0027.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1654","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5205","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0866.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0866","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0866.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0866.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-956j-qpwc-85cf/GHSA-956j-qpwc-85cf.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1654/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0866.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--25cc586d-41b4-4eb6-9f39-4050eba7ce78.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0982.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0981","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0981.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0863","title":"Lyris ListManager 缓冲区溢出本地提权漏洞","description":"listmanager 2.105.1 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于软件对输入数据长度缺乏有效校验，本地攻击者可通过向目标程序传递超长输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖关键内存区域并执行任意代码，从而实现权限提升，获得系统更高控制权限。该漏洞需要攻击者具备本地账户访问权限，CVSS评分7.2，危害等级为高危。受影响用户应立即升级至2.105.1或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0863"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37.550","remediation":"立即将 listmanager 升级至 2.105.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。若无法升级，应立即停止使用 listmanager 或替换为其他安全的邮件列表管理软件。作为临时缓解措施，限制本地用户对 listmanager 二进制文件的访问权限（chmod 750），并确保 listmanager 进程以最小权限运行（非 root 用户）。同时启用系统级缓冲区保护机制（如 stack canary、ASLR）以增加攻击难度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-09/0111.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0863","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0863.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2rxj-58vc-g6vw/GHSA-2rxj-58vc-g6vw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0863.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83016/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--98eafe92-8ea6-4562-b5a8-36fc7f698907.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0981.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0980","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0980.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0862","title":"Allaire Spectra 未授权信息访问漏洞","description":"Allaire Spectra 1.0.1 版本的管理界面工具存在未授权访问漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该工具读取和修改系统的敏感配置信息。由于攻击复杂度低且可通过网络直接访问，攻击者可借此获取关键配置参数或篡改系统设置，进而可能导致服务中断或权限提升。建议用户升级至修复版本或严格限制管理界面的网络访问权限，以降低安全风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0862"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37.423","remediation":"由于 Allaire Spectra 已被 Macromedia（后并入 Adobe）收购并停止维护，该产品不再提供安全更新。建议采取以下措施：1）立即限制对管理界面工具的网络访问，通过防火墙规则仅允许可信 IP 地址访问管理端口，阻止外部直接访问；2）若管理接口绑定在公网，应尽快将其隔离至内网或通过 VPN 接入；3）尽快迁移至受支持的现代 Web 开发平台（如 Adobe Experience Manager 或其他替代方案），彻底淘汰已停产的 Spectra 系统；4）在迁移前，确保管理接口的默认凭据已修改并启用强认证机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vendor/2000-q3/0059.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5466","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0862","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0862.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8pr8-33qh-2h66/GHSA-8pr8-33qh-2h66.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88339/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3940e07c0108f0ccff15cf6d7011c1c64b16d80e/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0980.toml"}]